To observe the server's idle behavior, my approach was to start the Grafana server in development mode and observe the logs during the idle state.
First, I started the Grafana server using the pre-built binary. 
```
$ ./bin/linux-amd64/grafana-server --homepath=. --config=./conf/defaults.ini
```

After the server has been running for at least 60 seconds with no user requests these are the recurring log entries that appear:
