The alert scheduler ticker starts with a 10 second interval, managing background tasks like alert state evaluation. The state cache initializes with 0 states since no user dashboards exist yet, and the usage stats collector becomes ready after approximately 38 seconds of idle time.

To get runtime evidence of the database migration check, I examined the server startup logs. When the server starts, Grafana runs migrations and logs their progress. I captured the specific output:
```
