logger=migrator t=2026-01-15T22:21:03.296112924Z level=info msg="Migration successfully executed" id="create migration_log table" duration=945.688µs
...
logger=migrator t=2026-01-15T22:21:09.190990522Z level=info msg="migrations completed" performed=626 skipped=0 duration=5.895942523s
logger=migrator t=2026-01-15T22:21:09.192134289Z level=info msg="Unlocking database"
```
This confirms that 626 migrations were performed with 0 skipped, taking about 5.9 seconds. When the schema is already up to date on subsequent starts, the output would show performed=0 skipped=626 instead, confirming the schema is current.

